WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:04.136
-Here at "Late Night,"
every night,

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:06.172
I deliver a monologue
comprised of jokes

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.473
written by
a diverse team of writers.

00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:10.143
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk that,

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:12.378
due to my being
a straight white male,

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:14.280
it would be difficult
for me to deliver.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.382
But we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them,

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:17.716
so we'd like
to share them with you now

00:00:17.716 --> 00:00:20.053
in a segment called
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:23.490
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.392
These are two of our writers,
Amber and Jenny.

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:28.160
-I'm black!
-And I'm gay!

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.496
-And we're both women.

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:32.966
-And I'm not,
so here's how this works.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:34.967
I'll read the setups
for these jokes,

00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:37.437
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:38.738
Here we go.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.974
Scientists are mourning
after the world's

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:43.609
last male northern white rhino
has died.

00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:46.446
-Meanwhile,
black rhinos die every day,

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:47.846
and nobody says [bleep]

00:00:47.846 --> 00:00:54.353
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:57.357
-The San Francisco Bay Area
recently hosted a conference

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:59.592
for lesbians
involved in the tech industry.

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:03.530
-"Hey, I have that Polo shirt!"
said everyone to everyone else.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:04.764
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:06.532
-Jenny, what's
the most popular thing

00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:08.401
on display at
a lesbian tech conference?

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.003
-That haircut.
-All right.

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:13.339
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.339 --> 00:01:16.009
-"Air &amp; Space Magazine"
recently published an article

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:19.813
about a historical event known
as the Black Christmas Disaster.

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:23.883
-It's about the time my family
ran out of sweet-potato pie.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:25.051
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:27.153
Just kidding --
that has never happened.

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:29.689
My mom has five or six
in the freezer right now

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:31.324
just in case I get sad.

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:32.959
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:35.695
-A library in Chicago
will host an exhibit next month

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:37.096
called Gay is Good.

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:40.065
-It's expected to be
unpopular with Trump supporters

00:01:40.065 --> 00:01:41.767
because it's in a library.

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:49.308
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:01:49.308 --> 00:01:51.711
-"The Washington Post"
recently published an article

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:54.547
about a little-known type
of wine called black wine.

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:58.151
-Or as it's more commonly known
"caber-nae-nae."

00:01:58.151 --> 00:01:59.786
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.754
-The Vatican
recently refused to host

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:03.456
an International Women's Day
conference

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:05.458
because one of the speakers
was a lesbian.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.260
-And because they're too busy

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:10.229
hosting a 2,000-year-long
pedophile convention.

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:12.465
[ Audience groans, laughter ]

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:14.968
-Now, wait.
Jenny, are you Catholic?

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:16.068
-I am.

00:02:16.068 --> 00:02:17.937
-Huh. I've never seen
a gay Catholic.

00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:19.905
-Oh.
Have you looked in the closet?

00:02:19.905 --> 00:02:22.474
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.474 --> 00:02:23.809
All right,
we've got one more joke.

00:02:23.809 --> 00:02:24.810
Who's gonna take it?

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.212
-Neither of us.
We're tired.

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:27.780
-But we brought a friend
to help us.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:30.049
Come on out!

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:36.122
-Hey!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:37.957
-Tiffany Haddish, everyone!

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:40.592
-Whoo!
I am!

00:02:40.592 --> 00:02:43.095
-All right!
Here we go.

00:02:43.095 --> 00:02:44.497
-I am Tiffany.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:47.667
Yes, I am, and thank you for
being able to tell us apart.

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:50.436
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:52.639
-I just tried to remember,
Amber, right.

00:02:52.639 --> 00:02:53.639
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.639 --> 00:02:56.074
All right, so here we go.

00:02:56.074 --> 00:02:58.911
Denzel Washington will appear
on Broadway next month

00:02:58.911 --> 00:03:01.147
in the classic play
"The Iceman Cometh."

00:03:01.147 --> 00:03:04.483
-And the women in the audience
will also cometh.

00:03:04.483 --> 00:03:06.786
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:06.786 --> 00:03:09.355
-That was great.
Very well done, very well done.

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:11.657
-Hey, Seth.
Why don't you tell one?

00:03:11.657 --> 00:03:12.992
-No, I-I couldn't.
I couldn't.

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:14.160
-Come on, tell one.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.661
-No, I feel like
if I tell one of these,

00:03:15.661 --> 00:03:17.497
I'm gonna get in trouble.
-Oh, just do it!

00:03:17.497 --> 00:03:19.599
-Okay, okay!
I trust you guys.

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:20.833
-Okay, yeah.

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:23.202
A new study has found
that the average mom

00:03:23.202 --> 00:03:26.572
gets one hour and seven minutes
of time to herself every day,

00:03:26.572 --> 00:03:29.475
and she uses it to complain.

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:31.043
-How dare you!

00:03:31.043 --> 00:03:33.379
-She just had your baby!

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:35.415
-You told me it would be okay!

00:03:35.415 --> 00:03:37.116
-I'm shocked.
I'm shocked!

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:39.418
-In a lobby!
-You lied to me!

00:03:39.418 --> 00:03:40.486
-You're a bad man!

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:42.855
Black women
and lesbians are liars!

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:46.259
[ Cheers and applause ]

